# Applies to the build context used by frontend/Dockerfile (context: ./frontend).
# Excluding node_modules matters for correctness, not just speed: without
# this, `COPY . .` in the builder stage would overwrite the image's freshly
# `npm install`-ed node_modules with whatever happens to be on the host
# (wrong platform's native binaries, stale lockfile state, etc.).

node_modules
.next
out
coverage
.git
.swc
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
.env*.local
.DS_Store
